cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, its code, or its analytical materials, please
  cite it using the metadata below.
title: "Predicting Prostatic Capsule Penetration: A Modern Extension of a 2018 Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hedayati
    given-names: Navid
repository-code: "https://github.com/navidhedayati9/prostatic-capsular-penetration"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible historical and modern logistic-regression analysis of
  prostatic capsule penetration. The project reproduces a 2018 SDSU analysis
  and extends it using prespecification, formal model-complexity assessment,
  repeated cross-validation, calibration evaluation, model-stability
  assessment, and sensitivity analyses.
keywords:
  - R
  - logistic regression
  - clinical prediction
  - repeated cross-validation
  - reproducible research
  - prostatic capsule penetration
  - prostate cancer
